Error: managed standalone Codex++ install not found at [CODEX_HOME]/packages/app-server-daemon/current/bin/codex++

This command requires the standalone install managed by the Codex++ installer, because the daemon starts and updates app-server from that fixed path.

Repair the existing installation, or run `codex++ app-server daemon start` to install a missing daemon.

Install it with:
  curl -fsSL https://github.com/yuguorui/codex/releases/latest/download/install-fork.sh | sh

Then rerun the command you just tried.
To work without the background server, rerun the same command with --no-daemon (including resume or fork and its arguments).
